  "content_html": "<p><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiUpbStNP-TxUBUP6xQTwKo10gJoMMF9x2EexFx37Qnbeg2mrbcXCAdURGifEkjS-IM1oM01w4bfqt9aukMGZ1-kkNqdObrworXibAH9SVs6X0dcfyAGSXQndplhg6pknRax8zHd5iTf56BPaNaXmTvEIx7WOkAsypjjxB83Tm1LCvfVFYpypPYd_F4XYo/s291/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"רישום של ילד עם כובע מצחייה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"291\" data-original-width=\"219\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiUpbStNP-TxUBUP6xQTwKo10gJoMMF9x2EexFx37Qnbeg2mrbcXCAdURGifEkjS-IM1oM01w4bfqt9aukMGZ1-kkNqdObrworXibAH9SVs6X0dcfyAGSXQndplhg6pknRax8zHd5iTf56BPaNaXmTvEIx7WOkAsypjjxB83Tm1LCvfVFYpypPYd_F4XYo/s16000/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" /></a></p><h2 style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🎈&nbsp;</span><span data-end=\"108\" data-start=\"73\" style=\"font-family: arial;\">שיחה בציורים – הפרת נדרים</span></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">🍎 <span data-end=\"142\" data-start=\"128\"><b>תַּפּוּחַ </b>(מכריז)<br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">ראשׁ הַשָּׁנָה מִתְקָרֵב! מִי רוֹצֶה אוֹתִי עִם דְּבַשׁ?</span></span></p>\n<p data-end=\"267\" data-start=\"205\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🍯 <strong data-end=\"220\" data-start=\"208\">דְּבַשׁ&nbsp;</strong>(מצטרף)<br data-end=\"223\" data-start=\"220\" />\nבּוֹאִי תִּטְעֲמִי אוֹתִי לְשָׁנָה מְתוּקָה!</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"337\" data-start=\"269\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👧 <strong data-end=\"284\" data-start=\"272\">נַעֲרָה&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">(עצובה)<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">נָדַרְתִּי שֶׁלֹּא לֶאֱכוֹל תַּפּוּחִים לְעוֹלָם.</span></span></p>\n<p data-end=\"416\" data-start=\"339\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🍎 <strong data-end=\"356\" data-start=\"342\">תַּפּוּחַ&nbsp;</strong>(מתפלא)<br data-end=\"359\" data-start=\"356\" />\nמָה? אֲבָל ראשׁ הַשָּׁנָה! לָמָּה לֹא אוֹכְלִים אוֹתִי?</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"479\" data-start=\"418\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👨‍👧&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"432\" data-start=\"424\">אָב&nbsp;</strong>(לא יודע מה לעשות)<br data-end=\"435\" data-start=\"432\" />\nהוֹלְכִים לִשְׁאוֹל אֶת הָרַב מַה לַעֲשׂוֹת.</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"676\" data-start=\"481\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">👨‍⚖️ <strong data-end=\"495\" data-start=\"487\">רַב&nbsp;</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">(פותח ספר)<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כָּתוּב בַּתּוֹרָה:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שֶׁ</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הָאָב&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יָכוֹל&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">לְהָפֵר&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּלְבַטֵּל&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אֶת הַנֶּדֶר&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בְּאוֹתוֹ&nbsp;יוֹם&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שֶׁשָּׁמַע עָלָיו.<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">מָתַי שָׁמַעְתָּ עַל הַנֵּדֶר שֶׁל בִּתְּךָ</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">?</span></span></p>\n<p data-end=\"791\" data-start=\"678\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👨‍👧&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"692\" data-start=\"684\">אָב&nbsp;</strong>(ממהר לענות)<br data-end=\"695\" data-start=\"692\" />לִפְנֵי שָׁעָה בְּעֵרֶךְ. וַאֲנִי לֹא מְרֻצֶּה מִזֶּה.</span></p><p data-end=\"791\" data-start=\"678\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👨‍⚖️&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"495\" data-start=\"487\">רַב&nbsp;</strong></span>(מחייך)<br /><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אָז אַתָּה יָכוֹל עֲדַיִן לְהָפֵר אֶת הַנֵּדֶר.</span></span></p><p data-end=\"791\" data-start=\"678\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">👨‍👧&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong data-end=\"692\" data-start=\"684\">אָב&nbsp;</strong>(מודיע בקול)<br data-end=\"695\" data-start=\"692\" />\nאֲנִי מֵפֵר אֶת הַנֶּדֶר שֶׁלָּךְ כְּדֵי שֶׁתּוּכְלִי לֶאֱכוֹל תַּפּוּחַ בְּדְּבַשׁ בְּשִׂמְחָה.</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"881\" data-start=\"793\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🕊️ <strong data-end=\"809\" data-start=\"797\">שָׁלוֹם:</strong><br data-end=\"812\" data-start=\"809\" />\nכָּךְ תִּכָּנְסִי לַשָּׁנָה החֲדָשָׁה בְּשִׂמְחָה וּבְרִגְעֵי מְתִיקוּת.</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"984\" data-start=\"883\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">🍎🍯 <strong data-end=\"913\" data-start=\"888\">תַּפּוּחַ בְּדְּבַשׁ:</strong><br data-end=\"916\" data-start=\"913\" />\nיֵשׁ! עַכְשָׁו תּוּכְלִי לֶאֱכוֹל אוֹתִי לְשָׁנָה טוֹבָה וּמְתוּקָה!</span></p><p data-end=\"984\" data-start=\"883\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><div><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">תפזורת</span></h2></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>מצאו את&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-weight: bold;\">🔍</strong><span>&nbsp;נדר, שבועה, החריש, מלחמה, מכס, גלעד.</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>בכיוונים&nbsp;</span><span>⬅️ ➡️ ⬇️ ⬆️</span></span></div><p data-end=\"984\" data-start=\"883\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhoDW1mTdXSNM04gyFBcmslpeoQmxFZInZEOjohd5pvpIaRSWc0K4KBpZkiffjxr1fcgB_cTIIQT_nGcZIGoZHiY9tw57tfXu5HfVae9XVypIccEYNFg_eXUMKY9RtzZWjF5sH01nMOLEPXlqGSvL4TtxC7iktASX56kOGb15qKI-AbNZ2yXTmoaqaZQMU/s464/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"457\" data-original-width=\"464\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhoDW1mTdXSNM04gyFBcmslpeoQmxFZInZEOjohd5pvpIaRSWc0K4KBpZkiffjxr1fcgB_cTIIQT_nGcZIGoZHiY9tw57tfXu5HfVae9XVypIccEYNFg_eXUMKY9RtzZWjF5sH01nMOLEPXlqGSvL4TtxC7iktASX56kOGb15qKI-AbNZ2yXTmoaqaZQMU/s320/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><p></p><br /><div><br /></div><p data-end=\"984\" data-start=\"883\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div><div><span><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">נכון או לא?</span></h2></span></div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><p></p></span></div><ol style=\"text-align: right;\"><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּאֶרֶץ גִּלְעָד הָיָה עֵשֶׂב רַב לִבְהֵמוֹת?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הָאָב יָכוֹל לְבַטֵּל אֶת הַנֵּדֶר שֶׁל בִּתּוֹ?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לַמִּדְיָן הָיוּ 5 מְלָכִים?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">הָאִשָּׁה יְכוֹלָה לְבַטֵּל אֶת הַנֵּדֶר שֶׁל בַּעְלָהּ?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל עָשׂוּ מִלְחָמָה עִם מִדְיָן?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">לְשֵׁבֶט זְבוּלוּן הָיָה מִקְנֶה רַב?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">יָאִיר בֶּן מְנַשֶּׁה כָּבַשׁ אֶת חַוּוֹת יָאִיר?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּנֵי גָּד וּרְאוּבֵן הִתְחַיְּבוּ לִצְעֹד רִאשׁוֹנִים בַּמִּלְחָמָה?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">אֶת בִּלְעָם בֶּן בְּעוֹר זָרְקוּ מֵרֹאשׁ הָהָר?</span></li><li><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">כְּדֵי לְהַכְשִׁיר סִיר לֹא כָּשֵׁר - שׁוֹרִים אוֹתוֹ בְּאֵקוֹנוֹמִיקָה?&nbsp;</span></li></ol>"
}
